{"unit_id":"yoggu__dsh-cache-warmer#feature-1","repo":"yoggu/dsh-cache-warmer","commit":"ed80a4763a9f907e3fe98af727f5fef007cd9322","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cache-warmer 的功能「观察缓存寿命」：插件记录真实模型请求报告的缓存 token，并显示估算剩余寿命；估算值由模型策略提供，不代表服务端保证。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:304-315","lib/index.js:90-110"]}
{"unit_id":"yoggu__dsh-cache-warmer#feature-2","repo":"yoggu/dsh-cache-warmer","commit":"ed80a4763a9f907e3fe98af727f5fef007cd9322","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cache-warmer 的功能「按模型配置保温」：用户可按 provider 和 model 配置缓存寿命及启用状态；未知寿命或禁用策略不会安排自动刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-27","lib/policy.js:1-40"]}
{"unit_id":"yoggu__dsh-cache-warmer#feature-3","repo":"yoggu/dsh-cache-warmer","commit":"ed80a4763a9f907e3fe98af727f5fef007cd9322","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cache-warmer 的功能「按预期收益刷新」：插件依据缓存命中、模型价格、活跃状态和费用门槛计算是否值得刷新，缺少价格或缓存证据时不发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:280-302","lib/policy.js:112-130"]}
{"unit_id":"yoggu__dsh-cache-warmer#feature-4","repo":"yoggu/dsh-cache-warmer","commit":"ed80a4763a9f907e3fe98af727f5fef007cd9322","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cache-warmer 的功能「会话级授权与状态」：Web 会话可单独开启保温；弹出界面呈现等待、计划中、刷新或不可用等状态及原因。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:318-330","client.js:8-10"]}
{"unit_id":"yoggu__dsh-cache-warmer#caveat-1","repo":"yoggu/dsh-cache-warmer","commit":"ed80a4763a9f907e3fe98af727f5fef007cd9322","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cache-warmer 使用前须知：刷新默认关闭，需模型策略和会话授权；部分路由还需单独允许 best-effort 刷新，取消不保证服务端停止生成。（见 lib/index.js:15）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-21","README.md:21-22"]}
{"unit_id":"yoggu__dsh-cache-warmer#caveat-2","repo":"yoggu/dsh-cache-warmer","commit":"ed80a4763a9f907e3fe98af727f5fef007cd9322","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cache-warmer 使用前须知：缓存寿命是本地估算。配置的寿命只是本地排程假设，不会设置服务端缓存保留期限；缺少已观察缓存命中或价格时不会自动刷新。（见 lib/policy.js:112-130）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/policy.js:112-130","README.md:31-34"]}
{"unit_id":"yoggu__dsh-cache-warmer#caveat-3","repo":"yoggu/dsh-cache-warmer","commit":"ed80a4763a9f907e3fe98af727f5fef007cd9322","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cache-warmer 使用前须知：依赖受支持的原生路由。原生刷新针对经过版本核对的 pi-ai adapter；其他或不兼容路由保持仅观察状态。（见 lib/pi-ai.js:8-14）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/pi-ai.js:8-14","README.md:7-8"]}
